WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:21.273
Squirrel: I sleep at night.

2
00:00:21.274 --> 00:00:42.401
I sleep in a tree.

3
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:52.734
Rabbit: I sleep at night.

4
00:00:52.735 --> 00:01:04.068
I sleep in a hole.

5
00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:14.445
Frog: I sleep at night.

6
00:01:14.446 --> 00:01:27.246
I sleep on a lily pad. Turtle:

7
00:01:27.247 --> 00:01:37.746
I sleep at night.

8
00:01:37.747 --> 00:01:53.622
I sleep underwater. Owl:

9
00:01:53.623 --> 00:01:59.203
I do not sleep at night.

10
00:01:59.204 --> 00:02:02.743
Squirrel: You don't sleep at night?

11
00:02:02.744 --> 00:02:05.334
Owl: No.

12
00:02:05.335 --> 00:02:09.430
Rabbit: What do you do at

13
00:02:09.431 --> 00:02:13.477
night? Owl: I wake

14
00:02:13.478 --> 00:02:33.533
up. And I fly!

15
00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:37.134
Turtle: Please fly somewhere

16
00:02:37.135 --> 00:02:43.729
else. Because we sleep at night!

